summary.text:
Validates the whole form (every input, textarea, select, radio,
checkbox, and file field) without submitting it. Always async;
always returns a

), and - for
images - dimension limits. Async, since checking image dimensions
requires decoding the file.

readme.text:
```js
import NFSFU234FormValidation from 'nfsfu234-form-validation';

const form = new NFSFU234FormValidation({ form: 'loginForm' });

document.getElementById('loginForm').addEventListener('submit', () => {
  form.submit().then((result) => {
    if (result.type === 'success') {
      // validated (and submitted via AJAX, if configured)
    }
  });
});
```

```js
NFSFU234FormValidation.configureForms([
  {
    form: '#loginForm',
    fields: {
      email: { required: true, type: 'email' },
      password: { required: true, minLength: 8 }
    },
    ajaxOptions: { RequestMethod: 'POST', RequestType: 'json' }
  },
  {
    form: '#contactForm',
    fields: { message: { required: true, maxLength: 500 } }
  },
  {
    form: '#profileForm',
    fields: {
      avatar: { required: true, accept: ['image/png', 'image/jpeg'], maxSizeMB: 2, maxWidth: 1000, maxHeight: 1000 },
      resume: { accept: ['.pdf'], maxSizeMB: 5 }
    }
  }
]);

// once per page - only wires up whichever registered form actually exists on this page
NFSFU234FormValidation.autoInit();
```

